      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Press and hold Press on the Button. The ADSR rises over its Attack, falls to its Sustain over its Decay and holds there while you hold; let go and it falls away over its Release. Its Value grows the light and its glow, through two Reframe Ranges. Its trace draws the shape: try a long Attack or a Sustain of 0."
        }
      },
